{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "name": "Experiment 003 - Focused connectivity pilot",
  "question": "Can mixed quality-directed breeding and batch-aware novelty improve finite-localizer search yield at a matched exact budget? Boundary localization is reported as a competing diagnostic.",
